  {
   "id": 646793,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n  <li>The quadratic equation <span data-math=\"x^2+7x+10=0\">x^2+7x+10=0</span> is in the form of <span data-math=\"ax^2+bx+c=0\">ax^2+bx+c=0</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>What is the value of <span data-math=\"a\">a</span>?</li>\n</ol>",
