  {
   "id": 646797,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Complete the unfinished steps, then <strong>select two</strong> solutions.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>-10</li>\n  <li>-5</li>\n  <li>-2</li>\n  <li>-4</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
   "id": 646798,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Substitute the values of <span data-math=\"a\">a</span>, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, and <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> into the quadratic formula, <span data-math=\"x=\\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2- 4ac}}{2a}\">x=\\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2- 4ac}}{2a}</span>, but do not evaluate any of the expressions. Explain how this expression is related to solving <span data-math=\"x^2+7x+10=0\">x^2+7x+10=0</span> by completing the square.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1273397,
     "content_html": "For this equation, the quadratic formula and completing the square are not the same and therefore not related."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273398,
     "content_html": "They are related because neither one can have a negative <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> value."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273399,
     "content_html": "Rather than evaluating at each step, the calculation is done all at once, at the end."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273400,
     "content_html": "In both forms of solving the equation, you need to list the values of <span data-math=\"a\">a</span>, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, and <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> to determine the solutions."
    }
   ],
